    "title": "Stabbert Marine and Industrial upgrades to Anacortes working waterfront: built, not bought - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Clean Ports partner spotlight: Stabbert Marine and Industrial has announced they will build a submersible barge right here in Anacortes. On Thursday, April 2, Stabbert presented an update on their amended project plan to the Port of Anacortes Commission. Instead of using $11 million of their EPA Clean Ports Grant funding to purchase a travel lift built in Wisconsin, Stabbert has pivoted and decided to keep that money local for the submersible project. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
